{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_18685a6efffd4cacbf8a7cb4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"6:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3368\">\n    <frame id=\"6:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"6:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"6:5\" name=\"Fitness App — workouts and daily activity\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"6:6\" name=\"Design a fitness app: get started, pick a workout or continue today’s plan, explore programs, open a workout to see its rounds, and review today’s activity report. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"6:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the map and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1185\">\n      <text id=\"6:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1096\">\n        <frame id=\"6:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"6:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:16\" name=\"Goal: Feel motivated and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get Started” • Copy: “Wherever you are, health is number one” · “There is no instant way to a healthy life” • Media: Photo_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"6:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:20\" name=\"→ Get Started → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:21\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"6:22\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"84\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:23\" name=\"Goal: Pick a popular workout or continue today’s plan.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:25\" name=\"• Greeting: “Good Morning 🔥” · “Pramuditya Uzumaki” • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Explore / Analytics / Profile · current: Home • Popular Workouts: “Popular Workouts” · Lower Body Training · Hand Training, each with photo, kcal (Icon_Fire), minutes (Icon_Timer) and play (Icon_Play) (see DATA) • Search: “Search” (Icon_Search) • Today Plan: “Today Plan” · Push Up · Sit Up · Knee Push Up, each with photo, daily goal, progress and level (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"6:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:27\" name=\"→ Lower Body Training → 04_Workout → Explore tab → 03_Explore → Analytics tab → 05_Analytics\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:28\" name=\"03_Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"400\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"6:29\" name=\"03_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:30\" name=\"Goal: Discover programs and challenges.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:32\" name=\"• Banner: “Best Quarantine Workout” · “See more” (Icon_Chevron_Right, Photo_Quarantine_Workout) • Best for you: “Best for you” · 4 programs, each with photo, minutes and level (see DATA) • Challenge: “Challenge” · Plank Challenge · Sprint Challenge · Squat Challenge • Fast Warmup: “Fast Warmup” · 2 programs, each with photo, minutes and level (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"6:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:34\" name=\"→ Home tab → 02_Home → Analytics tab → 05_Analytics\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:35\" name=\"04_Workout\" x=\"668\" y=\"400\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"6:36\" name=\"04_Workout\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"109\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:37\" name=\"Goal: Understand a workout and start it.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:39\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · “Let’s Workout” • Description: see DATA • Header: “Workout” • Media: Photo_Lower_Body_Training • Rounds: “Rounds” · 1/3 · Jumping Jacks 00:30 · Squats 01:00 · Backward Lunge 00:30, each with photo and play (Icon_Play) • Stats: “Time” 50 min (Icon_Timer) · “Burn” 500 kcal (Icon_Fire) • Title: “Lower Body Training”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"6:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:41\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:42\" name=\"05_Analytics\" x=\"0\" y=\"780\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"6:43\" name=\"05_Analytics\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"116\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:44\" name=\"Goal: Review today’s activity.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:46\" name=\"• Calendar: “July 2022” · S 10 – S 17 · current: T 12 • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Analytics • Report: “Today Report” · Active calories · Training time · Cycling (Map_Cycling_Route, Icon_Cycling) · Heart Rate (Icon_Heart_Rate) · Steps (Icon_Steps) · “Keep it Up! 💪” · Sleep (Icon_Sleep) · Water (Icon_Water) (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:48\" name=\"→ Home tab → 02_Home → Explore tab → 03_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:49\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1765\" width=\"1312\" height=\"139\">\n      <text id=\"6:50\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:51\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar on 02, 03 and 05 with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Explore (Icon_Explore), Analytics (Icon_Analytics), Profile (Icon_Profile). Current: Home on 02, Explore on 03, Analytics on 05. How the current tab looks is yours. • 01_Onboarding → Get Started → 02_Home. 04_Workout is pushed from the Lower Body Training card on 02 and has no tab bar. • Entry only (no frame): Profile tab, search, Hand Training, plan rows, See more, programs, challenges, rounds, Let’s Workout, calendar days, report tiles.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"88\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:52\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1952\" width=\"1312\" height=\"683\">\n      <text id=\"6:53\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:54\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:55\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"594\">\n        <frame id=\"6:56\" name=\"User\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"6:57\" name=\"User\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:58\" name=\"Pramuditya Uzumaki · greeting “Good Morning 🔥”\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:59\" name=\"Popular workouts\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"6:60\" name=\"Popular workouts\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:61\" name=\"Lower Body Training · 500 Kcal · 50 Min (Photo_Lower_Body_Training) Hand Training · 600 Kcal · 40 Min (Photo_Hand_Training)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:62\" name=\"Today Plan\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"6:63\" name=\"Today Plan\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:64\" name=\"Push Up · 100 push ups a day · 45% · Intermediate (Photo_Push_Up) Sit Up · 20 sit ups a day · 75% · Beginner (Photo_Sit_Up) Knee Push Up · 20 knee push ups a day · 45% · Beginner (Photo_Knee_Push_Up)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:65\" name=\"Explore · Best for you\" x=\"0\" y=\"187\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"6:66\" name=\"Explore · Best for you\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:67\" name=\"Belly fat burner · 10 min · Beginner (Photo_Belly_Fat_Burner) Lose Fat · 10 min · Beginner (Photo_Lose_Fat) Plank · 5 min · Expert (Photo_Plank) Build Wider Biceps · 30 min · Intermediate (Photo_Build_Wider_Biceps)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:68\" name=\"Explore · Fast Warmup\" x=\"444\" y=\"187\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"6:69\" name=\"Explore · Fast Warmup\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:70\" name=\"Leg exercises · 10 min · Beginner (Photo_Leg_Exercises) Backward lunges · 5 min · Beginner (Photo_Backward_Lunges)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:71\" name=\"Explore · Challenge\" x=\"888\" y=\"187\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"6:72\" name=\"Explore · Challenge\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:73\" name=\"Plank Challenge · Sprint Challenge · Squat Challenge\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:74\" name=\"Workout (04)\" x=\"0\" y=\"374\" width=\"420\" height=\"220\">\n          <text id=\"6:75\" name=\"Workout (04)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:76\" name=\"Lower Body Training · Time 50 min · Burn 500 kcal “The lower abdomen and hips are the most difficult areas of the body to reduce when we are on a diet. Even so, in this area, especially the legs as a whole, you can reduce weight even if you don’t use tools.” Rounds 1/3: Jumping Jacks 00:30 (Photo_Jumping_Jacks) · Squats 01:00 (Photo_Squats) · Backward Lunge 00:30 (Photo_Backward_Lunges)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"152\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:77\" name=\"Analytics · July 2022\" x=\"444\" y=\"374\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"6:78\" name=\"Analytics · July 2022\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:79\" name=\"Days: S 10 · M 11 · T 12 (current) · W 13 · T 14 · F 15 · S 16 · S 17 Active calories 645 Cal · Training time 80% Heart Rate 79 Bpm · Steps 999/2000 · Keep it Up! 💪 Water 6/8 Cups · Sleep (chart, values illustrative)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:80\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2683\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"6:81\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:82\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"6:83\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"6:84\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"6:85\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand colors #BBF246 + #192126 and Lato • Media: photos, map, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:86\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"6:87\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"6:88\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, analytics tiles, level tags, progress, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, current day, pressed, playing, disabled • Headers, tab bar, workout cards, plan rows, level tags, stat chips, round rows, day strip, analytics tiles, charts • How photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:89\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3023\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"6:90\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:91\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"6:92\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, current day, plan progress, round list)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"6:93\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 5 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f6b2263-6330-4721-ac9b-b0791a58bf93","uuid":"2190acbb-60fb-46cc-9b23-ad903d67c0d2","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:07:10.595Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"6:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3368\">\n    <frame id=\"6:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"6:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"6:5\" name=\"Fitness App — workouts and daily activity\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"6:6\" name=\"Design a fitness app: get started, pick a workout or continue today’s plan, explore programs, open a workout to see its rounds, and review today’s activity report. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"6:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the map and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1185\">\n      <text id=\"6:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1096\">\n        <frame id=\"6:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"6:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:16\" name=\"Goal: Feel motivated and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get Started” • Copy: “Wherever you are, health is number one” · “There is no instant way to a healthy life” • Media: Photo_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"6:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\