esign: charcoal card with lime play/flame? Use Icon_Play lime? Or decorative: challenge name 13 bold white centered + \"10 days\" small? No data given — don't invent numbers? \"Challenge: Plank Challenge · Sprint Challenge · Squat Challenge\" — no other data. Adding duration would be invented data — avoid. Just name. Card 110×96: name white bold 13 centered (2 lines ok), small lime chevron/play icon. Fine.\n  Alternatively horizontal scroll row of wider cards (170w) with 1.5 visible — checklist risk again. 3-across 110w shows all. Go 3-across, height 96. y610–706.\n- \"Fast Warmup\" header y722 h22 → 744. Rows y754: 2 rows h?? Only ~90px left before tab bar (tab bar starts ~764). NOT ENOUGH. Recompute!\n\n  Total needed: status 47 + header 30+10 + banner 110 + 16 + sec 22 + 10 + grid 2×148+10 = 306 + 16 + sec 22 + 10 + challenges 96 + 16 + sec 22 + 10 + warmup rows 2×56+8=120 + 12 + tabbar 80 = 47+40+110+16+22+10+306+16+22+10+96+16+22+10+120+12+80 = 955. Over by 111.\n\n  Slim down: banner 96 (-14), grid tiles 132 (photo 80) → rows 2×132+10=274 (-32), challenge 88 (-8), warmup rows 52 → 112 (-8), header 28 (-2), gaps 12 (-4*?) Let me recompute: 47 + (28+8) + 96 + 12 + (22+8) + 274 + 12 + (22+8) + 88 + 12 + (22+8) + 112 + 10 + 80 = 47+36+96+12+30+274+12+30+88+12+30+112+10+80 = 869. Still 25 over.\n\n  Options: tab bar 76 (floating 64 + margins) → 861. Tile 128 → 270 (-4) → 857. Banner 88 → 849. Warmup rows 48×2+8=104 → 845. Gap before tab 6 → 843. Ugh, razor thin. Everything cramped.\n\n  ALTERNATIVE: Best for you as 2×2 grid but tiles horizontal-compact (photo left 56×56, text right): tile height 72 → rows 2×72+10 = 154 (saves 120!). Then: 47 + 36 + 96 + 12 + 30 + 154 + 12 + 30 + 96 + 12 + 30 + 112 + 10 + 80 = 757. Comfortable! But photo-left tiles for \"Best for you\" less photo-forward... Actually with 56×56 photo + title + minutes + level in a white card 350×72 — looks like warmup rows. Hmm, \"Best for you\" with 4 programs as horizontal-scroll photo cards is the