n \"Rounds\" y577 + 1/3 badge\n- Round rows: y609, 667, 725 (62h, gap -4?? 609+62=671 → next 671+0... need gap: rows 609, 675, 741 → 741+62=803 ✗ too low; no tab bar here so bottom limit ~ 844-16=828. 609..671, 675..737, 741..803 ✓ no CTA button (not required explicitly — \"Let's Workout\" is the nav title). Bottom margin 41 ✓.\n- Home indicator y810 ✓.\n\nRound rows: Jumping Jacks 00:30 (Photo_Jumping_Jacks default ✓), Squats 01:00 (Photo_Squats), Backward Lunge 00:30 (Photo_Backward_Lunges). Override Photo swap, Title, Duration.\n1/3 badge: lime pill w36 h24 r12, \"1/3\" 12B charcoal centered at x334-36=314? section header instance at x20 w350; badge x314 y577.\n\n**05_Analytics** (x1880):\n- status 0..47\n- Page Title \"Today Report\" y58 (22B)\n- Calendar card y100..224: white r16 x20 w350 h124: month \"July 2022\" 15B x16 y14; chevron? skip. 8 day chips y46..102 (56h): x16 + i×40 (36w + 4 gap): 16,56,96,136,176,216,256,296 → last 296+36=332 ≤ 334 ✓. Days: S10, M11, T12(current), W13, T14, F15, S16, S17. Chips: inactive ×8 except T12 → dayOn.\n- Metric tiles 2×2 y240: (20,240),(200,240),(20,362),(200,362) — 170×110, gap 10 (20+170=190+10=200 ✓ 200+170=370 ✗ 350! 2×170+10=350 ✓ → x20, x200 → 200+170=370?? 350+20=370 ✗!! x2 = 20+170+10 = 200; 200+170=370 → frame is 390, right margin 20 → 370 ≤ 390-20=370 ✓ EXACTLY. OK x20 & x200 ✓ (inner width 350 = 170+10+170 ✓).\n  Tiles: Heart Rate (default metric tile ✓ 79 Bpm), Steps (icon Steps, green #55A812? tint #EFF7DC, value \"999\" + unit \"/2000\", label \"Steps\") + mini progress bar overlay, Sleep (icon Sleep violet #7C5CE0 tint #ECE7FC, value \"7.5\" unit \"hrs\", label \"Sleep\") + mini bars overlay, ... wait 4th tile: Cycling is full-width. Tiles: Heart Rate, Steps, Sleep, Water? Plus Active calories + Training time hero + Cycling map full width. Hmm layout budget:\n  - Calendar 100..224\n  - Hero tiles y240: Active Calories (dark, 170×110) + Training Time (lime, 170×110) → 240..350\n  - Metric row y362..472: Hea