lumn x224 — looks right-ish but sits a bit left (gap before play). Fine.\n   One thing: burn chip icon — fire renders charcoal in tint circle ✓.\n\n**05_Analytics**: screenshot timed out — retry.\n\n**Fix list**:\nA. Tag components → fixed 100×24 (primaryAxisSizingMode/counterAxisSizingMode FIXED, resize 100×24). This fixes Home rows, Explore tiles/rows.\nB. 02_Home search instance: measure Input child y; reposition so input at y114.\nC. Retry 05_Analytics screenshot.\n\nAlso on Explore: \"Challenge\" header was overlapped by tile overflow — after tag fix, verify.\n\nWait — one more check on 03: tiles row2 (Plank, Build Wider Biceps) photos overlap row1 content? In screenshot row spacing looks fine (photos at y~334 render...). The tile looks ~170 tall in render because of overflowing tags. After fix it should be clean.\n\nAlso Home plan rows: the goal text and pct and tag — after tag fix rows will look right.\n\nLet me also double check the Text Field master structure while fixing (get Input child y + label name) to compute correct placement.","signature":"da6ad9d7e9a5425889b32f31"}],"id":"c1c88c88-ff47-4052-9f84-453c22203588","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f6b2263-6330-4721-ac9b-b0791a58bf93","uuid":"8a60895c-48ad-43c1-8130-4d682cb92c9a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:40:42.157Z","thinking_duration_ms":19534}
